  <front>
    <title>vCard Format Extensions: ICANN Extensions for the Registration Data Access Protocol (RDAP)</title>
    <seriesInfo name="RFC" value="8605" stream="IETF"/>
    <date year="2019" month="May"/>
    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This document defines extensions to the vCard data format for
representing and exchanging contact information used to implement the
Internet Corporation for Assigned Names and Numbers (ICANN)
operational profile for the Registration Data Access Protocol (RDAP).
The property and parameter defined here are used to add values to
RDAP responses that are consistent with ICANN policies.</t>
    </abstract>
